    "UIName": "SM-3 Tank Destroyer",
    "Id": "vehicledef_SM3_CLAN_RT",
    "Name": "SM-3 Tank Destroyer",
    "Details": "The SM Tank Destroyer was designed as a speedy infighter by scientists from Clan Nova Cat. The machine is a cheap and effective combat vehicle. The vehicle has unique 'glass' dual cockpits on the front of the vehicle that are functionally identical while mounting a smaller anti-infantry turret just behind its left side cockpit. The vehicle's unique split cockpit design allows the cockpit modules to eject from the vehicle. Due to its appearance, the SM1 was dubbed the 'Suicide Machine' by its first pilots because they felt overexposed with the tank's all ferro-glass cockpit.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       255     25\n<b>Left</b>         155     25\n<b>Right</b>       150     25\n<b>Rear</b>        120     25\n<b>Turret</b>      150     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      830    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Stable Weapons</color>",
    "Icon": "SM1"
  },
